== test_standing_pause_reads_crew_state_only_on_the_recheck_cadence
ok - a standing pause reads crew state on first sight and the recheck cadence, never every idle poll
== test_redeclared_identical_pause_gets_a_new_first_sight
ok - a resolved-then-identical re-declared pause gets its own first-sight alert
== test_pause_recheck_cadence_ignores_unrelated_status_updates
ok - unrelated status updates do not reset a declared pause's bounded recheck cadence
== test_paused_until_anchor_is_the_declaration_stamp
ok - a declared pause's recheck is anchored on its own stamp, not a later unrelated status event
== test_exited_declared_pause_is_bounded_but_live_gate_surfaces
ok - exited declared-pause and captain-held panes use bounded pause cadence while a live decision gate still surfaces once
== test_nonterminal_stale_paused_absorbed_then_resurfaced
ok - a declared pause surfaces once on first sight, is absorbed, then re-surfaced as a recheck past the threshold, never wedge-escalated
== test_live_declared_wait_churn_honors_the_resurface_throttle
ok - a declared wait surfaces once on first sight, absorbs churn inside the cadence, then re-surfaces, for alive, unknown, and dead agents
== test_secondmate_declared_wait_first_sight_is_absorbed
ok - a secondmate's fresh declared wait absorbs its first stale sight on stable and new-hash paths, then re-surfaces on the cadence
== test_paused_authoritative_working_preserves_wedge_timer
ok - a paused status overridden by authoritative working preserves its wedge timer, is rechecked rather than wedge-escalated while the declaration stands, and escalates once it is lifted
== test_nonterminal_paused_rechecks_authoritative_state
ok - a declared pause is periodically rechecked against authoritative active-run state
== test_paused_until_wrong_year_is_bounded_by_the_cadence
ok - a wrong-year declared time cannot silence the watcher beyond the recheck cadence
== test_own_work_wait_keeps_first_alert_then_long_cadence
ok - own-work waits keep one first alert, then bounded rechecks without wedges; undeclared idle still alarms
